## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design offline-capable telemetry at the edge with guaranteed delivery and strict tenancy isolation.

## Key Concepts

- Edge buffering, per-tenant isolation, idempotent writes
- Out-of-order handling and replay-safe semantics
- Pluggable sinks and backpressure-aware flushing
- Testing offline durability and cross-tenant isolation

